==Turkish==

===Etymology===
From {{inherited|tr|trk-oat|tr=şu}}, from {{m|trk-oat|tr=şol}} (by analogy of {{m|tr|bu||this}}), from earlier {{m|trk-oat|tr=uş ol}}, equivalent to {{m|tr|uş||lo!}} + {{m|tr|o||she, he, it, that}}. Compare {{m|tr|şimdi||now}}, {{m|tr|işte||lo!}}. Cognate with {{cog|kk|сол}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|tr|/ʃu/}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|tr|pronoun}}

# [[that]] (that over there)
#: {{ux|tr|'''Şu''' kedi diğerlerinden daha zayıf.|'''That''' cat is thinner than the others.}}
#: {{ux|tr|'''Şuna''' bak!|Look '''at that'''!}}
#: {{ux|tr|'''Şunlar''' senin arkadaşların değil mi?|Aren't '''those''' your friends?}}

